1880490/extras/2181d963658d3a9314b8734edd1af64e.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/2181d963658d3a9314b8734edd1af64e.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The characters can interact with each other and these interactions will be recorded too creating complex playback pattern.<br>Intertwine their timelines to solve brain-melting puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No pressure</strong> </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/7a4f80299eb7cc7db0f86aecc0638e52.poster.avif?t=1670492762\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1880490/extras/7a4f80299eb7cc7db0f86aecc0638e52.webm?t=1670492762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>You can't lose and there is no time constraint in the game. If you make a mistake, navigate the timeline and go back in time !",
